<font size=1><a target='_new' href="
http://rpgvault.ign.com/features/den/bmcqa01.shtml">Black Moon Chronicles Q&A #1</a></font>
<br>Submitted by: RPG Vault
 on 12/4/2001 10:45:11 AM
<p>Les Chroniques de la Lune Noire (Black Moon Chronicles) is a French graphic novel series set in a complex world filled with conspiracies, chicanery and a constantly shifting web of alliances.  Vircom is bringing this setting to the PC in a colorful online world, and in our Black Moon Chronicles Q&A #1, we had the chance to obtain a lot of background information from Communications & Marketing Manager François Bourdeau.
<hr>
