http://rpgvault.ign.com/features/intelligence/blackmoon.shtml">Black Moon Chronicles Intelligence Report</a></font>
<br>Submitted by: N/A
 on 11/14/2001 7:41:02 AM
<p>RPG Vault takes a look at an intriguing online world currently in development at Vircom for release early next year.<p>
Vircom's Black Moon Chronicles promises to capture players' attention with a strong, story-based approach involving the conflicts and shifting alliances amongst four factions. Following a recent announcement, the game is now slated to ship in March of next year, so we thought it would be a good time for our new fact sheet-style Black Moon Chronicles Intelligence Report.
